- English + Spanish localization across all screens
- Add strings to the shared catalog in the CLI and regenerate to extend it

## Architecture

- **Expo Router** file-based navigation (`app/`)
- **RTK Query** base API (`src/api/baseApi.ts`) + per-feature endpoints (`src/features/*/api.ts`)
- **Zustand** auth store with secure persistence (`src/store`)
- **Feature folders** for screens (`src/features`)
- **Design tokens** with light/dark themes (`src/theme`)
- **Config + observability** (`src/core`)

## Replacing the mock API

The RTK Query slice uses `fakeBaseQuery` with data from `src/api/mockData.ts`.
Replace the mock endpoints in `src/features/<feature>/api.ts` with real
requests using `fetchBaseQuery` in `src/api/baseApi.ts`, then delete
`mockData.ts`.

